Grammar

    0 $accept: root "end of file"

    1 root: program

    2 program: vars classes entry
    3        | classes entry
    4        | vars entry
    5        | entry

    6 class: CLASS ID CLB optnewline vars methods CRB
    7      | CLASS ID CLB optnewline vars CRB
    8      | CLASS ID CLB optnewline methods CRB
    9      | CLASS ID CLB optnewline CRB

   10 classes: class stmtEnd
   11        | classes class stmtEnd

   12 vars: var stmtEnd
   13     | vars var stmtEnd

   14 method: ID LP params RP COLON type stmtBl
   15       | ID LP RP COLON type stmtBl
   16       | ID LP error RP COLON type stmtBl

   17 methods: method optnewline
   18        | methods method optnewline

   19 params: ID COLON type
   20       | params COMMA ID COLON type

   21 var: VOLATILE ID COLON type ASSIGNOP expression
   22    | VOLATILE ID COLON type
   23    | ID COLON type ASSIGNOP expression
   24    | ID COLON type

   25 type: baseType LB RB
   26     | baseType
   27     | ID
   28     | VOID

   29 baseType: INT_EXPR
   30         | FLOAT_EXPR
   31         | BOOL_EXPR

   32 expression: expression PLUSOP expression
   33           | expression MINUSOP expression
   34           | expression MULTOP expression
   35           | expression DIVOP expression
   36           | expression POWEROP expression
   37           | expression AND expression
   38           | expression OR expression
   39           | expression LESSOP expression
   40           | expression MOREOP expression
   41           | expression LESSEQOP expression
   42           | expression MOREEQOP expression
   43           | expression COMPOP expression
   44           | expression NOTEQOP expression
   45           | expression LB expression RB
   46           | expression DOT LENGTH
   47           | expression DOT ID LP RP
   48           | expression DOT ID LP funcopt1 RP
   49           | baseType LB expression RB
   50           | baseType LB expression listopt1 RB
   51           | factor

   52 listopt1: COMMA expression
   53         | listopt1 COMMA expression

   54 funcopt1: expression
   55         | funcopt1 COMMA expression

   56 factor: INT
   57       | FLOAT
   58       | STRING
   59       | ID LP RP
   60       | ID LP funcopt1 RP
   61       | TRUE
   62       | FALSE
   63       | ID
   64       | NOT expression
   65       | LP expression RP

   66 stmt: PRINT LP expression RP
   67     | RETURN expression
   68     | BREAK
   69     | CONTINUE
   70     | IF LP expression RP stmtBl
   71     | IF LP expression RP stmt
   72     | IF LP expression RP stmtBl ELSE stmtBl
   73     | expression
   74     | var
   75     | READ LP expression RP
   76     | expression ASSIGNOP expression
   77     | FOR LP foropt1 COMMA foropt2 COMMA expression ASSIGNOP expression RP stmtBl

   78 foropt1: var
   79        | expression ASSIGNOP expression
   80        | ε

   81 foropt2: expression
   82        | ε

   83 stmts: stmt stmtEnd
   84      | stmts stmt stmtEnd
   85      | stmts error stmtEnd
   86      | error stmtEnd

   87 stmtEnd: NEWLINE
   88        | stmtEnd NEWLINE

   89 optnewline: ε
   90           | optnewline NEWLINE

   91 stmtBl: CLB stmtEnd stmts CRB
   92       | CLB stmts CRB
   93       | CLB error CRB
   94       | CLB CRB

   95 entry: MAIN LP RP COLON INT_EXPR stmtBl


